        <purpose><para>On izeltlabuak.hu users can record their arthropod observations. These records can be utilized for various scientific and educational purposes. The platform's capabilities extend further, as it automatically generates distribution maps for species based on the aggregated user data. These maps serve as a crucial tool for identifying shifts in the distribution of invasive species and enhancing our understanding of the distribution patterns of all arthropod species within the country. Additionally, these recorded observations stand as invaluable resources for scientific research and educational activities.</para></purpose>
