        <methods>
            <methodStep>
                <description>
                    <para>Observation recorded by the community and verified by the experts of the community</para>
                </description>
            </methodStep>
            <qualityControl>
                <description>
                    <para>On the izeltlabuak.hu web application professionals or experts contribute by validating and identifying the recorded arthropods. They are users with a specific user role called &apos;identifiers&apos;. They have access specific pages of the website where they can give their identifications for the observations. They will be recognized as the identifier in the appearances of the observations. It is possible for the identifiers to set an another person as the identifier of the observation as they get the determination personally or got it on a social platform. Identifiers can modify or overwrite previous determinations if they find it to need correction. If taxonomic changes have been made, the corrector will be the new identifier. One observation has only one actual identification. Identifiers must accept the ethical codex for the webpage as well as the users.</para>
                </description>
            </qualityControl>
        </methods>

